--- !u!114 &1209034249
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1209034247}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 602e508ab3a03db42a7d1a884c3f6b31, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CityPerson
  displayName: Foreman Ruiz
  nameColor: {r: 0.75, g: 0.5, b: 0.1, a: 1}
  personId: plant_boss_foreman_ruiz
  firstMeeting:
  - Mind the grating. Carmen Ruiz, I run the plant.
  - 'Trash, scrap, sludge, crops that came up wrong from dirty soil: bring it here and it is dealt with properly.'
  - It costs a fifth of what the stuff is worth. Bring a mixed load and I'll charge you the cheap rate for all of it.
  - Or you can do what the tower does and tip it in the river for nothing. I can't stop you. The forest will send you the bill.
  lines:
  - We could clean the whole river in a season if the tower stopped filling it.
  - Every barrel that comes through that door is one that isn't going past your farm.
  - Sam from the suburbs does three mornings a week here. Quiet. Writes on the back of the delivery notes.
  - People say this job stinks. They're right. Somebody still has to do it.
  oneLineOnly: 0
  service: {fileID: 1893113379}
  serviceLabel: Hand over waste
  portraitIdle: {fileID: 91594836, guid: ae50d159e46eb7748951666fa22e3d56, type: 3}
  portraitTalk: {fileID: 2064544277, guid: ae50d159e46eb7748951666fa22e3d56, type: 3}
  portraitHappy: {fileID: -1656878219, guid: ae50d159e46eb7748951666fa22e3d56, type: 3}
  portraitBlink: {fileID: -942680788, guid: ae50d159e46eb7748951666fa22e3d56, type: 3}
